Z||000011||DaRkLoRD||11-02-2000||12:29 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by JMergen:<BR><B>Don't know what you guys got aganist wings,but you 'kaint get no more Marican' than a 70 Super Bird. In fact I'd like to see a setup like that on a Fiero.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Correctly proportioned wings are fine.. if they're 12" tall, or have multiple wings stacked on top of each other, it's just plain stupid looking IMHO... and definitely ricey, but not even good ricey.. (some ricer stuff I like, such as the blue tinted headlights.. hurts my eyes to look at them though, but as long as I'm driving.. it won't bother me.. lol)<P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||13
