Z||000014||Philphine||11-03-2000||01:53 AM||||an f 40 wing from a late 80s-early 90s mustang would kind of give you a superbird look. i plan to get one for a future fiero project.<P>the trunk demensions are close enough that coupe/conv. style mustang wings fit a fiero. got a saleen wing from those years on my '87. look in muscle mustangs and fast fords mag. for a motion performance add. ridicule all you want but sooner or later if you're in louisville you may see a fiero with that wing.<BR><P>------------------<BR>Phil T<P>'87 coupe (feral)<BR>'84 indy<BR>'84 coupe (cheap thrill)||||reg||1
